{"seq":1,"slug":"state-management-ngrx","title":"状态管理：NgRx","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/angular-in-depth/advanced/state-management-ngrx","wordCount":1291,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"状态管理-ngrx\">状态管理：NgRx</h1><p>不是每个应用都需要 NgRx。当状态属于某个组件、或只在父子间用 <code>input</code>/<code>output</code> 传递时，引入全局状态库纯属过度工程。但当同一份状态被许多互不相邻的组件读写——购物车被导航栏、商品页、结算页同时关心；当前用户被半个应用依赖——靠组件间传递会演变成「prop 钻透地狱」和难以追踪的更新。这时需要一个集中、可预测的状态容器。本篇讲清何时需要它，以及 2026 年 NgRx 的重心 Signal Store 与经典 NgRx 的取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>NgRx 如今有两套并存的方案。经典 NgRx 遵循 Redux 模式：状态是单一不可变 store，组件派发 action 描述「发生了什么」，reducer 是纯函数据此算出新状态，effect 处理 action 引发的副作用（如调 API），selector 从 store 取派生数据。NgRx Signal Store 则用第二章的信号原语重写：状态、派生、方法用 <code>withState</code>/<code>withComputed</code>/<code>withMethods</code> 声明式组合，没有 action、reducer、effect 的样板。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  subgraph 经典 NgRx Redux 流&#10;  C1[组件] --&gt;|dispatch action| R[reducer 纯函数]&#10;  R --&gt; S[单一 store 状态]&#10;  S --&gt;|selector| C1&#10;  C1 -.触发.-&gt; E[effect 副作用 调 API]&#10;  E --&gt;|新 action| R&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph Signal Store&#10;  W1[withState 状态信号] --&gt; W2[withComputed 派生]&#10;  W2 --&gt; W3[withMethods 方法 patchState]&#10;  W3 --&gt; W1&#10;  end\">flowchart TD\n  subgraph 经典 NgRx Redux 流\n  C1[组件] --&gt;|dispatch action| R[reducer 纯函数]\n  R --&gt; S[单一 store 状态]\n  S --&gt;|selector| C1\n  C1 -.触发.-&gt; E[effect 副作用 调 API]\n  E --&gt;|新 action| R\n  end\n  subgraph Signal Store\n  W1[withState 状态信号] --&gt; W2[withComputed 派生]\n  W2 --&gt; W3[withMethods 方法 patchState]\n  W3 --&gt; W1\n  end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>经典 NgRx</th>\n<th>NgRx Signal Store</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>范式</td>\n<td>Redux：action/reducer/effect/selector</td>\n<td>信号：state/computed/methods/hooks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样板量</td>\n<td>多</td>\n<td>少（无 action/reducer）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>底层响应式</td>\n<td>RxJS + store</td>\n<td>信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作用域</td>\n<td>通常全局</td>\n<td>全局或组件级皆可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2026 定位</td>\n<td>大型严格审计场景</td>\n<td>多数新应用首选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"何时需要全局状态\">何时需要全局状态</h2><p>引入 NgRx 之前先问：这份状态真的需要全局吗？判断标准是「共享广度」与「生命周期」。被多个不相邻组件读写、且需要跨路由存活的状态（用户会话、购物车、应用级配置）适合放进 store；只属于一个组件子树的状态（一个表单的草稿、一个面板的展开态）放在组件里或组件级 provider 即可，用 <a href=\"../foundations/dependency-injection\">依赖注入</a> 的元素注入器作用域就够。过早引入全局状态会把本可局部的复杂度上升为全局复杂度。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是，纯 Angular 服务加信号在很多中小应用里已足够——一个 <code>@Injectable({ providedIn: &#39;root&#39; })</code> 的服务，内部用 <a href=\"../reactivity/signals\">Signals 响应式</a> 的 <code>signal</code>/<code>computed</code> 管理状态，对外暴露只读信号和修改方法，就是一个轻量状态容器。2026 年社区的共识是：先用「服务 + 信号」，复杂到需要结构化约束时再上 Signal Store，只有大型、需严格可审计变更轨迹的场景才上经典 NgRx。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ngrx-signal-store\">NgRx Signal Store</h2><p>Signal Store 是 2026 年 NgRx 的主推方案，用 <code>signalStore()</code> 把一组「特性」组合成一个状态容器。核心特性有 <code>withState</code>（声明状态，自动暴露为信号）、<code>withComputed</code>（声明派生信号）、<code>withMethods</code>（声明修改状态的方法，用 <code>patchState</code> 做不可变更新）、<code>withHooks</code>（生命周期，如初始化时加载数据）。它产出的是一个可注入的服务，组件用 <code>inject()</code> 取用，读状态就是读信号。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export const CartStore = signalStore(&#10;  { providedIn: &#39;root&#39; },&#10;  withState&lt;{ items: CartItem[] }&gt;({ items: [] }),&#10;  withComputed(({ items }) =&gt; ({&#10;    count: computed(() =&gt; items().length),&#10;    total: computed(() =&gt; items().reduce((s, i) =&gt; s + i.price * i.qty, 0)),&#10;  })),&#10;  withMethods((store) =&gt; ({&#10;    add(item: CartItem) {&#10;      // patchState 做不可变更新&#10;      patchState(store, (s) =&gt; ({ items: [...s.items, item] }));&#10;    },&#10;    clear() {&#10;      patchState(store, { items: [] });&#10;    },&#10;  })),&#10;  withHooks({&#10;    onInit(store) {&#10;      /* 初始化时可加载持久化数据 */&#10;    },&#10;  }),&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> CartStore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> signalStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { providedIn: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'root'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  withState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CartItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] }>({ items: [] }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  withComputed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    count: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">computed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">computed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i.price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i.qty, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  withMethods</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CartItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // patchState 做不可变更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      patchState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(store, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ items: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">s.items, item] }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    clear</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      patchState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(store, { items: [] });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  withHooks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    onInit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      /* 初始化时可加载持久化数据 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export class HeaderComponent {&#10;  private cart = inject(CartStore);&#10;  count = this.cart.count; // 直接拿到派生信号&#10;  total = this.cart.total;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HeaderComponent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> cart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(CartStore);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cart.count; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 直接拿到派生信号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  total</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cart.total;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>patchState</code> 强制不可变更新，这与 <a href=\"../reactivity/signals\">Signals 响应式</a> 里「更新必返回新引用」和 <a href=\"../reactivity/change-detection\">变更检测</a> 里 OnPush 依赖引用相等是同一条纪律——正因为状态是信号且不可变，任何读取它的组件都能在 Zoneless 下被精确刷新。Signal Store 还能用 <code>providedIn: &#39;root&#39;</code> 做全局单例，或不带该选项、放进某组件/路由的 <code>providers</code> 做局部作用域存储——后者配合 <a href=\"../engineering/routing\">路由与懒加载</a> 的路由级 provider，能为每个功能区隔离一份状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"经典-ngrx-与异步\">经典 NgRx 与异步</h2><p>经典 NgRx 仍是大型、强约束场景的选择，它的价值在「可审计的单向数据流」：每次状态变化都有一个明确的 action 记录「为什么变」，配合 Redux DevTools 能做时间旅行调试、回放、追因。它的异步靠 effect——监听特定 action，执行副作用（通常是 HTTP），再派发成功/失败 action 回到 reducer。这套机制重度依赖第二章 <a href=\"../reactivity/rxjs-observables\">RxJS 与可观察对象</a> 的操作符：effect 本质是一条 RxJS 管道，用 <code>switchMap</code>/<code>exhaustMap</code> 等处理请求竞态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"loadUsers$ = createEffect(() =&gt;&#10;  this.actions$.pipe(&#10;    ofType(UserActions.load),&#10;    switchMap(() =&gt;&#10;      this.api.getUsers().pipe(&#10;        map((users) =&gt; UserActions.loadSuccess({ users })),&#10;        catchError((err) =&gt; of(UserActions.loadFailure({ err }))),&#10;      ),&#10;    ),&#10;  ),&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">loadUsers$ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.actions$.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    ofType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(UserActions.load),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    switchMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.api.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getUsers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UserActions.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">loadSuccess</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ users })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        catchError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">err</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(UserActions.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">loadFailure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ err }))),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>成本也清楚：一个简单功能要写 action、reducer、effect、selector 四类文件，样板沉重。这正是 Signal Store 出现的动因——它在 80% 的场景里用十分之一的样板提供了足够的结构化。选型原则：默认服务加信号；需要结构化的可复用 store 用 Signal Store；唯有大型团队、严格变更审计、强依赖 DevTools 时间旅行的场景，才值得经典 NgRx 的样板代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>全局状态非默认选项：被多个不相邻组件读写、需跨路由存活的状态才放进 store，局部状态用组件或元素注入器作用域即可。</li>\n<li>2026 年的推荐阶梯：服务 + 信号（多数中小应用）→ NgRx Signal Store（需结构化复用）→ 经典 NgRx（大型、需审计与时间旅行）。</li>\n<li>Signal Store 用 <code>withState</code>/<code>withComputed</code>/<code>withMethods</code>/<code>withHooks</code> 声明式组合，<code>patchState</code> 不可变更新，产出可注入服务，读状态即读信号。</li>\n<li><code>patchState</code> 的不可变纪律与 OnPush/Zoneless 的引用相等一脉相承，使读取状态的组件能被精确刷新；store 可全局或路由/组件级局部作用域。</li>\n<li>经典 NgRx 提供可审计的单向数据流与 DevTools 时间旅行，异步靠 RxJS 驱动的 effect，但样板沉重，仅在大型强约束场景值得。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"状态管理：NgRx","id":"状态管理-ngrx"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"何时需要全局状态","id":"何时需要全局状态"},{"level":2,"text":"NgRx Signal Store","id":"ngrx-signal-store"},{"level":2,"text":"经典 NgRx 与异步","id":"经典-ngrx-与异步"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"表单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/angular-in-depth/engineering/forms"},"next":{"title":"性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/angular-in-depth/advanced/performance"}}